---
title: Ceviche Tostada
servings: 1
course: special
season: Summer 2026
source: Chef-Project/ceviche_tostada_costing.xlsx
recipe cost: 4.0108
author: Luis Bibiano-Balbuena
---

Cure the @mahi mahi{1.5%oz} cubed small in citrus, ~{20%min}.

Boil the @prawns 16/20{2.5%oz} in Old Bay and lemon, chop, chill.

Cure the @bay scallop 60/80{1.6%oz} in lime, lemon and @Aleppo pepper{0.006%oz},
then chop.

Combine the cured seafood with @roma tomato{0.2%oz} small dice, @red onion{0.15%oz}
small dice, crushed @garlic{0.025%oz}, @pickled jalapeno{0.1%oz} small dice and
@jalapeno brine{0.05%oz} in a #mixing bowl{}.

Dress with @lime juice{0.2%oz}, @lemon juice{0.1%oz}, @champagne vinegar{0.05%oz},
@tomato juice{0.2%oz}, @cocktail sauce{0.2%oz} and @Old Bay{0.013%oz}.
Season with @salt and pepper{}.

Batch fry the @corn tortilla{3%ea} until they set flat and crisp.

Build: lemon dressed @coleslaw mix{2%oz} on the tostada, ceviche over,
@pickled red onion{1%oz} on top, @beet aioli{0.5%oz} drizzled across.
